      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds okay but i want to make sure it's not too confusing for them. can u actually write out the specific talking points for the \"regressive\" side of the civil rights case study you mentioned? i want to show them the arguments people used back then so they understand why those views were considered stubborn or regressive at the time.",
